[h1]Verification / 验收[/h1]

The release uses a reproducible 28-file staging tree. An isolated MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 run from a fresh subscribed Workshop cache verifies the real Chaos event, empty-de-jure Later title, personally retained land, loyalist realm tree, non-loyalist release, exact 50%/51% boundary, the Kaifeng-centered camera, decision visibility, full vanilla restoration effect, and Later-title destruction.
正式版本使用可复现的 28 文件 staging。全新订阅缓存已经通过隔离的 MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 实机链：真实群雄割据事件、空法理后朝、旧天子本人继续持有原直辖领地、尊王派封臣树、非尊王派脱离、精确 50%/51% 边界、开封镜头、决议显示、完整原版复辟效果与后朝销毁均已验证。

[h1]Localization / 本地化[/h1]

English / 简体中文 / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

The seven additional release languages were generated as MiniMax-M3 candidates and reviewed and corrected for meaning, terminology and CK3 formatting. This is model-led review, not native-speaker certification.
七种新增发布语言先由 MiniMax-M3 产出候选，再逐条审核并修正语义、术语与 CK3 格式；这是模型代行的发布审核，不冒充母语译者认证。

[h1]Compatibility / 兼容性[/h1]

Requires CK3 1.19.0.6 and All Under Heaven. Start a new single-player game. This mod overrides exactly two vanilla keys: [code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code] and [code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code]. Mods replacing either key may conflict by load order.
需要 CK3 1.19.0.6 与《溥天之下 / All Under Heaven》，推荐新开单人存档。本 mod 只覆写两个原版 key：[code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code] 与 [code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code]；其他 mod 若覆写其中之一，可能发生加载顺序冲突。

